    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge strategy with relaxation as you build your own number-spelling machine. Every number you complete fuels your growth, while powerful bonuses reward efficient play. Will you optimize your upgrades to reach astronomical figures, or simply enjoy the mesmerizing rhythm of numbers unfolding into language?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Idle Number Spelling</strong><br>Turn numbers into words automatically over time. Each letter spelled grants you income, creating a soothing sense of progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Deep Upgrade System</strong><br>Invest in upgrades like <i>Income Per Letter</i>, <i>Spelling Speed</i>, <i>Number Finish Bonus</i>, and more to multiply your earnings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd22 <strong>Infinite Numbers</strong><br>Climb into the trillions and beyond with a dynamic system that supports massive quantities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Clean, Minimalist Visuals</strong><br>A sleek dark theme with neumorphic UI makes your idle empire feel elegant and modern.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc12 <strong>The Infinite Monkey Theorem</strong><br>Hire Monkeys to help spell faster\u2014because eventually, they\u2019ll get it right.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Strategic Choices</strong><br>Decide when to upgrade, skip numbers, or invest in new income streams to maximize efficiency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Calming Atmosphere</strong><br>Background music and satisfying sound design create a relaxing experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbe <strong>Progress Persistence</strong><br>Your progress is always saved\u2014return anytime to pick up where you left off.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a fan of idle games, word games, or simply want something unique to relax with, <strong>Numenclature</strong> offers an endlessly compelling way to watch numbers come to life.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge strategy with relaxation as you build your own number-spelling machine. Every number you complete fuels your growth, while powerful bonuses reward efficient play. Will you optimize your upgrades to reach astronomical figures, or simply enjoy the mesmerizing rhythm of numbers unfolding into language?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Idle Number Spelling</strong><br>Turn numbers into words automatically over time. Each letter spelled grants you income, creating a soothing sense of progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Deep Upgrade System</strong><br>Invest in upgrades like <i>Income Per Letter</i>, <i>Spelling Speed</i>, <i>Number Finish Bonus</i>, and more to multiply your earnings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd22 <strong>Infinite Numbers</strong><br>Climb into the trillions and beyond with a dynamic system that supports massive quantities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Clean, Minimalist Visuals</strong><br>A sleek dark theme with neumorphic UI makes your idle empire feel elegant and modern.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc12 <strong>The Infinite Monkey Theorem</strong><br>Hire Monkeys to help spell faster\u2014because eventually, they\u2019ll get it right.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Strategic Choices</strong><br>Decide when to upgrade, skip numbers, or invest in new income streams to maximize efficiency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Calming Atmosphere</strong><br>Background music and satisfying sound design create a relaxing experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbe <strong>Progress Persistence</strong><br>Your progress is always saved\u2014return anytime to pick up where you left off.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a fan of idle games, word games, or simply want something unique to relax with, <strong>Numenclature</strong> offers an endlessly compelling way to watch numbers come to life.</p>",
